WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.740
that are just not able to send their people anymore.

00:03.740 --> 00:05.840
They used to send them to us in caravans

00:05.840 --> 00:08.600
of 25,000, 30,000 people each,

00:08.600 --> 00:12.500
these massive caravans of people pouring into our country,

00:12.500 --> 00:14.200
totally unchecked and unvetted.

